s61:s53,s60,s26,s38,s52:fsumf1o |- ( ( N e. NN /\ G : Prime --> CC ) -> sum_ t e. ~P { q e. Prime | q || N } prod_ p e. t ( G ` p ) = sum_ d e. { x e. NN | ( ( mmu ` x ) =/= 0 /\ x || N ) } prod_ p e. { q e. Prime | q || d } ( G ` p ) )
qed:s61,s12:eqtr3d |- ( ( N e. NN /\ G : Prime --> CC ) -> sum_ d e. { x e. NN | ( ( mmu ` x ) =/= 0 /\ x || N ) } prod_ p e. { q e. Prime | q || d } ( G ` p ) = prod_ p e. { q e. Prime | q || N } ( 1 + ( G ` p ) ) )
